  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Please add a speed limit when falling. Even games such as HL Alyx have a speed cap when falling.\nAlso, reset the player velocity on respawn, so you don't gain speed forever.\nIt's a really awful feeling being in VR and falling nonstop while hunting for the Alt+F4 keys.\nThis problem is going to get more common, because the new default player controller in SDK3/Udon takes control away from the user to stop a dizzying fall.",
